   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## starter 06 \u00b7 finishing a clip\n\n**You need:** a video in ComfyUI/input (any clip: a director export, an LTX clip, a render). No models.\n\n**Do:** pick the clip in node 1, Queue. It gets the colours of the reference picture (node 3; one transform for\nevery frame, so nothing flickers), deflicker calms brightness jumps between frames, retime makes it half speed with\noptical-flow in-betweens, burn in writes name, frame and timecode for a review copy.\n\n**Then try:** `save_lut` in node 4 writes the look as output/kubakub_luts/<name>.cube (After Effects, Resolume,\nMadMapper); *kubakub apply lut* uses any .cube; bypass burn in for the delivery file and send the frames to\n*kubakub export video / frames*.\n"
   ],
   "title": "read me"
  }
